docs {
  # V1 API Information
  
  Returns information about the V1 API, including available features and endpoints.
  
  ## Response (200 OK)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "V1 API information retrieved successfully",
    "data": {
      "version": "v1",
      "features": ["profiles", "authentication"],
      "status": "stable",
      "endpoints": {
        "auth": "/api/v1/auth",
        "profiles": "/api/v1/profiles"
      },
      "timestamp": "2024-01-16T15:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Notes
  
  - This endpoint does not require authentication
  - Use this endpoint to discover available features in the V1 API
  - The `status` field indicates the stability of the API version
  - All V1 endpoints are prefixed with `/api/v1`
}

